      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 7.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Hello doctor sorry I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.17,
      "end_seconds": 13.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.62,
      "end_seconds": 22.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "doctor, uh, it's a growing red ring on my thigh. It's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 27.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "so, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.05,
      "end_seconds": 30.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "nothing regular, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.54,
      "end_seconds": 35.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.44,
      "end_seconds": 40.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "it's been going on for about a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.66,
      "end_seconds": 44.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.49,
      "end_seconds": 72.36,
      "duration_seconds": 22.87,
      "text": "Aching muscles goes along with it, most of the time. And there's a mild headache as well, five days now. About mild headache, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. The Aching muscles? That's been for one week. I had tiredness before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.06,
      "end_seconds": 76.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "have you noticed joint swelling or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.05,
      "end_seconds": 79.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.99,
      "end_seconds": 84.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "have you noticed stiff neck or facial weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.67,
      "end_seconds": 90.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "I haven't had stiff neck or facial weakness, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.81,
      "end_seconds": 94.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.82,
      "end_seconds": 97.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.91,
      "end_seconds": 106.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.04,
      "end_seconds": 121.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "hmm there was some antibiotic I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.54,
      "end_seconds": 142.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.32,
      "end_seconds": 150.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.29,
      "end_seconds": 154.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.01,
      "end_seconds": 156.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.23,
      "end_seconds": 159.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.82,
      "end_seconds": 164.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.23,
      "end_seconds": 168.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "my father had bowel cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.56,
      "end_seconds": 173.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.2,
      "end_seconds": 184.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago i told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.28,
      "end_seconds": 191.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.05,
      "end_seconds": 196.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.16,
      "end_seconds": 201.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.91,
      "end_seconds": 207.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.39,
      "end_seconds": 214.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "so, can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.76,
      "end_seconds": 227.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.77,
      "end_seconds": 248.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 71 beats a minute blood pressure 127 over 71 temp 36.4 degrees BMI works out to 20.1 height 161 centimetres weight 52 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.85,
      "end_seconds": 253.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.72,
      "end_seconds": 257.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.18,
      "end_seconds": 271.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "There is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the the thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.62,
      "end_seconds": 278.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.13,
      "end_seconds": 317.27,
      "duration_seconds": 23.14,
      "text": "Okay so my impression is this: This looks most like early Lyme disease. That's my thinking for now and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out cellulitis yet. Just to be sure I understood. You've had a growing red ring on your thigh for about a week and no stiff neck or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.86,
      "end_seconds": 320.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "yes that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.72,
      "end_seconds": 336.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on doxycycline 100 milligrams twice a day twenty-one days. It's for early Lyme disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.73,
      "end_seconds": 343.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Can I collect it from my own pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.57,
      "end_seconds": 355.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.12,
      "end_seconds": 358.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "I understand"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.96,
      "end_seconds": 370.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "book a a review in three weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.26,
      "end_seconds": 374.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "okay that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
